{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Hunters</strong> is an <strong>incremental</strong> game where you fight against <strong>waves of enemies and bosses</strong> through <strong>various stages</strong>, <strong>maps</strong>, and <strong>challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.poster.avif?t=1772625935\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.webm?t=1772625935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.mp4?t=1772625935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to <strong>buy upgrades</strong> in the <strong>skill tree</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, or other goods. Each character has <strong>unique features</strong>, weaknesses, and strengths, so pick the one that suits you best to win. Also, upgrades are varied and you can make multiple <strong>custom builds</strong> or <strong>synergies</strong>. These <strong>upgrades give</strong> <strong>new or empower old passives</strong>, award <strong>new abilities</strong>, unlock <strong>more skill trees</strong>, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map is made up of multiple levels and there's also <strong>post-end content</strong>, so get ready to fight a lot of bugs and protect your system against these threats.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274970?t=1772625935","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274970?t=1772625935","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/f9497b4e4c71a6dbf699d48c6d0d04abf995dbb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772625935","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/f9497b4e4c71a6dbf699d48c6d0d04abf995dbb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772625935","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Hunters</strong> is an <strong>incremental</strong> game where you fight against <strong>waves of enemies and bosses</strong> through <strong>various stages</strong>, <strong>maps</strong>, and <strong>challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.poster.avif?t=1772625935\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.webm?t=1772625935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/00c765131f627b331f67bcbe6477b4d9.mp4?t=1772625935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to <strong>buy upgrades</strong> in the <strong>skill tree</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, or other goods. Each character has <strong>unique features</strong>, weaknesses, and strengths, so pick the one that suits you best to win. Also, upgrades are varied and you can make multiple <strong>custom builds</strong> or <strong>synergies</strong>. These <strong>upgrades give</strong> <strong>new or empower old passives</strong>, award <strong>new abilities</strong>, unlock <strong>more skill trees</strong>, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map is made up of multiple levels and there's also <strong>post-end content</strong>, so get ready to fight a lot of bugs and protect your system against these threats.</p>","developers":["SnowsS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/0c510b5cef25b6b1ff88b6ce6c977476a8cd25fe/header.jpg?t=1772625935","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3274970/2077706348/12bc981f12b20d09e664d3d6f91c1c125ac3f409/1751486493/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751488742","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3274970/2077706348/12bc981f12b20d09e664d3d6f91c1c125ac3f409/1751486493/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751488742","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3274970/2077706348/12bc981f12b20d09e664d3d6f91c1c125ac3f409/1751486493/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751488742","id":257088774,"name":"Annoucement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257088774/3a097cc4670f41f327008029bf16c65b01af99f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751488742"}],"name":"Bug Hunters","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce MX130</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>